{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","雷光剑影"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Thunder Swordwork"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对范围内进行数次快速攻击，并进入“充盈”状态。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Valen launches several strikes within range and gains Invigoration."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个格子，对该格子和其周围1格范围内的区域进行7次神速斩击，每次斩击会对区域内的全体敌人造成70% + 10% ATK伤害，且斩击期间自身处于无敌状态。斩击结束后，使自身进入“充盈”状态，持续12秒。在“充盈”状态下，自身提高20%的攻击力。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Valen selects a tile and launches 7 Swift Strikes at the selected tile and its adjacent tiles. Each strike deals 70% + 10% ATK damage to all targets. Valen is invincible while striking. After striking, Valen gains Invigoration for 12s, increasing his ATK by 20%."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":116,"end":122,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":73,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":113,"end":126,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":159,"end":169,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至75% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases damage to 75% + 10% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":20,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/varian