escription_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 12% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升16%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 16% during battle."],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的攻击力提升20%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases ATK by 20% during battle."],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","惊雷永驻"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/en","Eternal Thunder"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","“充盈”状态永久持续，且伤害加成越来越高。"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/en","Valen gains permanent Invigoration and increasing ATK bonus."],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","“充盈”状态变为永久持续。每当维伦在“充盈”状态下使用终极技能时，将会使“充盈”状态提供的攻击力加成永久提高10%，最多叠加10次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Valen gains permanent Invigoration. When casting Thunder Swordwork during Invigoration, he permanently gains 10% ATK bonus, up to 10 stacks."],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击力加成的单次累加幅度提高至12%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases each stack of ATK bonus to 12%."],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","在“充盈”状态下，维伦的普通攻击将会引发闪电链，对周围2格范围内的另一名敌人造成普通攻击伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Triggers a lightning strike during a normal attack after gaining Invigoration, dealing equal amount of normal attack damage to an enemy within 2 tiles."],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击力加成的单次累加幅度提高至13%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases each stack of ATK bonus to 13%."],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/en","Enhance Force"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“奔雷怒斩”现在还会对敌人造成眩晕。"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/en","Valen stuns the enemy with Fury Thunder Strike."],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“奔雷怒斩”现在还会造成3秒的眩晕。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Valen inflicts a 3s stun with his Fury Thunder Strike."],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","获得500点初始能量，每次闪电对敌人造成伤害时额外获得60点能量，并使敌人降低20点急速和30点移速，持续2秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Valen gains 500 initial Energy. Whenever his lightning deals damage to an enemy, he gains 60 extra Energy and reduces that enemy's Haste by 20 and movement speed by 30 for 2s."],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","咏雷者"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/en","Stormcaller"]]}